  "full_description_bbcode": "[img src=\"{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/dab98dbd5d1ce67dc1eba25b09403da9.avif\" width=\"616\" height=\"346\" avif=\"{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/dab98dbd5d1ce67dc1eba25b09403da9.avif\" fromclient=1][/img]\r\n[b]Shadow of the Erdtree[/b] is an expansion to [b]ELDEN RING[/b], the [b]2022 Game of the Year[/b].\r\nDark and intense, [b]Shadow of the Erdtree[/b] has players continue their quest with the freedom to explore and experience the adventure at their own pace.\r\n\r\n[h2]• New immersive areas rich with secrets[/h2]\r\n[img src=\"{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/ea6725bb459ffe0fde415e5b0adaa17b.avif\" width=\"616\" height=\"346\" avif=\"{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/ea6725bb459ffe0fde415e5b0adaa17b.avif\" fromclient=1][/img]\r\nThe Realm of Shadow has been kept apart from the Lands Between since its creation. Now, in pursuit of Miquella, the Tarnished are among the first souls to set foot here in unknown ages. Traverse new open field areas to reach dense new legacy dungeons full of hazards and undiscovered mysteries.\r\n\r\n[h2]• Powerful and challenging enemies[/h2]\r\n[img src=\"{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/21690806c94703aecf65514a2961dbe8.avif\" width=\"616\" height=\"346\" avif=\"{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/21690806c94703aecf65514a2961dbe8.avif\" fromclient=1][/img]\r\nDangers both great and small will provide a formidable challenge for any player in the Realm of Shadow. New enemies roam the open areas and horrifying new monsters lurk in caverns and hollows, waiting to ambush the unaware. Anyone capable of surviving these intense battles will know the rush of true victory.\r\n\r\n[h2]• New weapons, spells, and armor to enhance your unique character[/h2]\r\n[img src=\"{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/c552b4ee61befe53741150240b7b9ae7.avif\" width=\"616\" height=\"346\" avif=\"{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/c552b4ee61befe53741150240b7b9ae7.avif\" fromclient=1][/img]\r\nMany new powers can be found in this scorched realm: weapons and armor, sorceries and incantations, and spirits and skills. You may find something unexpected to surprise an enemy, such as Thrusting Shields that combine offense and defense. Or, you may find something to complement your combat style, like hand-to-hand combat that combine palm strikes and kicks without a weapon.\r\n\r\n[h2]• Learn the untold story of an unseen war as you follow in Miquella’s footsteps[/h2]\r\n[img src=\"{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/b76efb85a22ed48a7d496f4a7706c192.avif\" width=\"616\" height=\"346\" avif=\"{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/b76efb85a22ed48a7d496f4a7706c192.avif\" fromclient=1][/img]\r\nYou aren’t the only one tracking Miquella through the Realm of Shadow, and as you press deeper and deeper into the mystery, you’ll find a complex interplay of personalities and motivations to navigate, giving you new insight into Miquella’s history and Marika’s hidden past.\r\n\r\n[i]*Shadow of the Erdtree content requires the base game product.\r\n*Other base game editions containing this content are also available. Be careful of duplicate purchases.[/i]",
